title: 'University pack-selector: full 3-surface fix (v6.6.5)'
summary: 'Thorough triage + fix of the University pack-selector bug across all three surfaces. v6.6.4 fixed only the MCP read tools; the CLI commands and the serve HTTP server had the same bug class because pack-loading logic is duplicated in three copies. Triaged ~14 findings (2 serve, 10 CLI, plus MCP onboard/search gaps), fixed via parallel per-package builders (architect→3 builders→integrated review), and live-verified: serve --pack ai-literacy mounts the pack''s 5 sections, serve --port honored.'
